      "role": "user",
      "content": "Got it. So if we're seeing that kind of inconsistency or \"acting up\" in the braking feel, is it usually a predictable linear decline in the coefficient, or is there a point where it just becomes totally unpredictable and erratic due to the thermal instability? I'm trying to understand if there's a sudden threshold where the system starts behaving in ways that seem almost malicious or just completely rogue.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
